// Core's Bash tool blocks `cd <cwd> && ...` with a "Blocked redundant cd" error to
// steer toward native tools / `-C` flags. Luke wants those to just run instead of
// erroring. We strip a leading redundant `cd <cwd>` (one that resolves to the session
